## Playbook: request

Use this template to drive feature work/refactors.

PHASE 0 — Reconnaissance (Read-Only)
- Non-destructive scan to build an evidence-based model. Output a ≤ 200-line digest. No mutations.

PHASE 1 — Planning & Strategy
- Restate objectives, impact surface (all affected files/workflows), and justified approach.

PHASE 2 — Execution
- Read-Write-Reread for each edited file; follow command execution canon; maintain workspace purity; update all consumers of shared changes.

PHASE 3 — Verification
- Run unit/integration/linters. Diagnose and fix failures autonomously.

PHASE 4 — Zero-Trust Self-Audit
- Re-verify final state, hunt regressions, confirm system-wide consistency.

PHASE 5 — Final Report
- Changes Applied, Verification Evidence, System-Wide Impact, Final Verdict string.

